  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"archive-header\">\n\n\t<h1 class=\"archive-title\">BANK SHOWS</h1>\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\n</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-4850 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-bank-shows category-events category-meet-the-artist category-monthly-meetings category-ornament-fundraiser category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists category-news\" id=\"post-4850\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/guild-news-december-2019/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"330\" height=\"242\" alt=\"A red and white logo.\" src=\"/media/archive/d628430c893acef788bc2bbe74472c5859c7875a114ebdc857cc9102d0377062.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/guild-news-december-2019/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Guild News December 2019</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2019-11-27T14:16:00-05:00\" title=\"Wednesday, November 27, 2019, 2:16 pm\">November 27, 2019</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Compiled by Joan Carroll The General Meeting will take place on January 25, 2020, not January 18, due to the Martin Luther King Holiday, from 2:00-4:00 p.m. Michael Rudden encourages <a href=\"/news/guild-news-december-2019/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder has-excerpt post-4421 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-art-in-the-park category-bank-shows category-plein-air category-events category-meet-the-artist category-the-gallery category-news tag-art-and-community tag-cape-cod-art-galleries tag-cape-cod-artist tag-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-4421\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/summer-kicks-off-with-the-guild-of-harwich-artists/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Summer Kicks Off with the Guild of Harwich Artists</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2019-06-27T09:21:05-04:00\" title=\"Thursday, June 27, 2019, 9:21 am\">June 27, 2019</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Guild of Harwich Artists is celebrating our 40th year with numerous art shows, public events and member engagements. Membership in the 80-person Guild is now open to all residents and taxpayers in Barnstable County.  For more information and membership application, visit www.guildofharwichartists.org.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder has-excerpt post-4088 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-bank-shows category-news tag-cape-cod-5-bank tag-harwich-port\" id=\"post-4088\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/maloney/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"473\" height=\"344\" alt=\"A painting of sailboats docked in the harbor.\" src=\"/media/archive/ae6d620c4440be626cbf6a4e887c0e11b347c3f5654a1d2c0fce5201b94695d5.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/maloney/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Maloney Exhibits at Cape Cod 5 Bank</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2019-01-06T16:12:40-05:00\" title=\"Sunday, January 6, 2019, 4:12 pm\">January 6, 2019</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>William J. Maloney, oil and watercolor painter, is the featured Guild of Harwich Artists bank show artist on display during the month of January 2019 in the lobby at Cape Cod 5 Bank, 532 Main St (Route 28), Harwich Port, MA 02646﻿ #ArtAndCommunity #Harwich</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-4040 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-bank-shows category-gallery-artists category-news\" id=\"post-4040\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/joan-gilligan-carroll-exhibits-in-harwich-port/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"777\" height=\"500\" alt=\"The logo for the artists' art show guild of harwich artists.\" src=\"/media/archive/b44212b16ef0c4452f95455fc6b995ab6e682f8bf1b9a26e51c5890a838ffa24.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/joan-gilligan-carroll-exhibits-in-harwich-port/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Joan Gilligan Carroll Exhibits in Harwich Port</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-11-01T12:11:36-04:00\" title=\"Thursday, November 1, 2018, 12:11 pm\">November 1, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Joan Gilligan Carroll, oil and watercolor painter, is the featured artist for November at the Cape Cod 5 in Harwich Port. Her coastal and landscape paintings are frequently sketched and <a href=\"/news/joan-gilligan-carroll-exhibits-in-harwich-port/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3761 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-artweek category-bank-shows category-events category-meet-the-artist category-monthly-meetings category-the-gallery category-news tag-artweekma tag-donna-julian-spillane tag-doris-mee tag-elaine-felos-ostrander tag-harwich-chamber-of-commerce tag-martha-little-fuentes tag-meet-the-artist tag-robin-litwin tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3761\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/may-guild-news/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" alt=\"A blank white image.\" src=\"/media/archive/756fb9062dc3b8319cf9143d170258ae733c4c39396c5a3879bbaaf72f244534.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/may-guild-news/\" rel=\"bookmark\">May Guild News</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-05-01T01:21:11-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, May 1, 2018, 1:21 am\">May 1, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>At the Guild meeting on April 21, members voted and approved of by-law changes which included: Guild membership is expanded to include residents or taxpayers of Barnstable County A “quorum” <a href=\"/news/may-guild-news/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3684 post 